{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121190609799-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121190609\"/><p>震央位於德令哈市附近。</p><p>青海海西州德令哈市附近周六（21日）晚上6時45分發生黎克特制5.7級地震，震源深度10公里。德令哈市宣傳部指震感強烈，目前正統計人員傷亡和財產損失情況。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:23:51.893722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:06:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:22.012749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:22.012749+00:00","content_hash":"df1c6bc30e0aed26091c06147eaa4f89b67567eb56b2a7851e245cfbe63f440b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}